Social Media Data Documentation
Overview
This repositoty contains de-identify social media post comments data follected for a doctoral dissertation research. The data is from the major Newspaper form Puerto Rico, "El Nuevo Día", 
and from Trinidad and Tobago, "Trinidad Express Newspaper". All personally identifiable information has benn removed to ensure participant privacy. All data was collected as public data 
that enyone can find and read in a public Facebook post.

Data Collection Information
Source Platforms
-Platform: Facebook
-Collection Period: From January 2020 to December 2020
-Collection Method: ESUIT | Comments Exporter For Fecbook [https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/esuit-comments-exporter-f/flhbkccofabjoiphncbedainkoipgggf?hl=en&pli=1]
-Language(s): The comments that are from Puerto Rico and Trinidad and Tobago are in Spanish and English respectively, also some variatios for spanglish, and creole. 

